From: Mixtile <support@mixtile.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: run decode_bl31.py under python3

The FIT generator executes decode_bl31.py via its shebang, which is python2.
The build container ships only python3. The script is already python3-clean
(range, bytes literals, %-formatting, struct -- no python2-only constructs),
so switch the shebang to python3.

diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py
index 42fa32d..1cff8c3 100755
--- a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-#!/usr/bin/env python2
+#!/usr/bin/env python3
 #
 # Copyright (C) 2020 Rockchip Electronics Co., Ltd
 #
